			"notes": "# 🎉 Initial Release / Pierwsze wydanie!\n\nThe official release of the **Fabric Radio Mod** for Minecraft 1.21.4.\n\n## ✨ Features / Funkcje:\n* **Background Audio Engine:** Listen to MP3 streams without any game lag.\n* **Live Station Search:** Built-in search engine powered by Radio Browser API.\n* **Smart Filters:** Sort stations easily by Country and Music Genre.\n* **Favorites System (★):** Save your best stations with one click.\n* **Metadata Toasts:** Dynamic corner-popups showing currently playing songs and station logos.\n* **Smart Blacklist (⛔):** Click the block button on a toast to permanently hide annoying phrases (e.g., \"AD\", \"News\").\n* **ModMenu Integration:** Fully customizable settings (volume, toast duration, blacklist editor).\n* **Auto-Translation:** Supports English and Polish (adapts to your Minecraft language).\n\n## ⚙️ Requirements / Wymagania:\n* **Minecraft:** `1.21.4`\n* **Loader:** `Fabric`\n* **Dependencies:** [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) (Required)\n* **Optional:** [ModMenu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) (Highly recommended for settings)\n\n## 📥 Installation:\nDownload the `radio-mod-1.0.0.jar` file below and place it in your `.minecraft/mods` folder. This is a **Client-Side only** mod!"
